    "postDate": "2026-08-18T14:31:46.160Z",
    "rawMarkdown": "I would expect a huge shakeup and lots of over fit models.  Since we need to create the labels, trusting your cv as a golden rule not very helpful. \n\nIt's pretty easy to spot what looks like conflicting results in the 58 gold labels we have received.  So we are trying to build models that predict the kaggle truth - often an elusive monster to grab hold of.\n\n",
    "content": "<p>I would expect a huge shakeup and lots of over fit models.  Since we need to create the labels, trusting your cv as a golden rule not very helpful. </p>\n<p>It's pretty easy to spot what looks like conflicting results in the 58 gold labels we have received.  So we are trying to build models that predict the kaggle truth - often an elusive monster to grab hold of.</p>",
